1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580
San Marcos, Kapitulo 9

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:05,000
Kinunanapay,

3
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,160
Laglagipan niyo daytoy.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,300
Adda sumagmamanukada kayo ditoy,

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,160
asaan tupay amatay,

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:16,120
aginga amakita dati ya ay tipagaryan ti Diyos,

7
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,500
agraman ti amin apan nakabalin.

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,160
Kalpasan tinem nga aldaw,

9
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:24,960
inkuyog Nesus da Pedro,

10
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:47,720
Pagamwan,

11
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:58,820
Nagsao ni Pedro kit kinunanak ni Nesus.

12
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,940
Kastaunay nga mintibuting dagiti adalan,

13
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:21,340
kit saan nga amon ni Pedro titumutop asawena.

14
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:24,720
Nagparang tiulip anang linong kadakwada,

15
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:28,280
kit adanang ngegda at imek anagapu itiulip.

16
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:29,520
Kinunana,

17
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:38,340
Dinagdagos da nga inwaras ni panagkita da,

18
00:01:38,900 --> 00:01:42,340
ngim awanin sa bali anakita da nudilaing Nesus.

19
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,820
Iti sumalsalog da itibantay,

20
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:46,920
imbilin Nesus kadakwada,

21
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:50,660
Awan pang ibagbagaan niyo iti na imatangan niyo.

22
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,420
Ibagayon tulaeng daytoy,

23
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:54,900
kalpasan,

24
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,960
iti panagungar ti anak ti tao.

25
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,520
Tinong paladaday taabilin,

26
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,520
nupay nagsisin na lutsod da.

27
00:02:02,020 --> 00:02:04,020
Anya ti kayat asawen,

28
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,020
iti panagungar ka dagiti na tay?

29
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:08,620
Inimtuod da akin kwana,

30
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:12,000
Apay akuna dagiti ma maestro iti linteg,

31
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:15,000
amasapol nga umay nga umunan ni Ilias?

32
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,500
Insung bat Nesus,

33
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:20,060
Pudno nga umay nga umunan ni Ilias,

34
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:22,720
tatno tarimaan na amin abanan.

35
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,720
Ngumapay,

36
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:27,280
anailan at itinasantuan asurat,

37
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:30,480
nga agsagaba itinapalalo ti anak ti tao,

38
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:32,480
ket maumsinto.

39
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:36,380
Ibagak ka da kayo nga imayen ni Ilias,

40
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:38,380
ket inaramid dagiti tat-tao

41
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:41,380
ti amin akinay kayat da ken kwana,

42
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:42,880
kas na isurat,

43
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:44,880
maipapan ken kwana.

44
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:50,380
Idiag subli da iti ayan dagiti daddo mga adalan,

45
00:02:50,380 --> 00:02:53,380
nakita da tinakad adu at tat-tao itilikmut da,

46
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:56,380
ken sumagmamano ama maestro iti linteg

47
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,380
ama kesinsinupyat ka dakwada.

48
00:02:58,380 --> 00:03:02,380
Apaman anakita dagiti tat-tao asumungad ni Ilias,

49
00:03:02,380 --> 00:03:04,380
naragsakan da,

50
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:07,380
ket nagtataray da aki mablaaw ken kwana.

51
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:09,380
An nga ti pagsusupyatan niyo?

52
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:11,380
Sinaludsod ni Ilias,

53
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:13,380
Maestro!

54
00:03:13,380 --> 00:03:15,380
Kinunan ti may isa ka dagiti tat-tao?

55
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:18,380
Inyeg ko ken katanak ko alalaki,

56
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:21,380
talinuganan ti dagas nga espirito,

57
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:23,380
ket saan ama ka sa'o.

58
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:26,380
Nusumruti dagas nga espirito,

59
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:28,380
ito blak na tubig,

60
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:30,380
aglabutab tingiwat na,

61
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:34,380
agngaryat ken sumkilti entero abagi na,

62
00:03:34,380 --> 00:03:36,380
kinit daw ko kadagiti adala mapaksyaten

63
00:03:36,380 --> 00:03:38,380
dati dagas nga espirito,

64
00:03:38,380 --> 00:03:40,380
ngabditan na baalaan.

65
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:42,380
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada,

66
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:46,380
Tat-tao nga awanan pamati,

67
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:49,380
kasanopay kabayag ti kaadak iti dinayo,

68
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:52,380
kasanopay kabayag ti panaganos ko kadakayo,

69
00:03:53,380 --> 00:03:55,380
Iyag nyo man kanyak taubing?

70
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:58,380
Inyasidegda ken kuwana ti ubing.

71
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:02,380
Apaman anakita ti dakes nga espirito ni Jesus,

72
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:04,380
pinagkuyagig na ti ubing.

73
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,380
Napasag ti ubing iti daga,

74
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:09,380
naggulgulagol nga aglablabutab tingiwat na.

75
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:12,380
Kaano ba'y akastoy ti mararamit ken kuwana?

76
00:04:12,380 --> 00:04:16,380
Inimtuod ni Jesus iti ama ti ubing.

77
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:18,380
Manipod pa'y iti ubing.

78
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,380
Insumbat ti ama na.

79
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:22,380
Masansan nga'y suba ti dakes nga espirito,

80
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:24,380
pati dakes nga espirito'y tapoy,

81
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:27,380
huwano ilang mas naitidanong tap'no patayon na.

82
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:32,380
No kaba'lam, pang aasim tatulungan na kami.

83
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:35,380
Apay ako nam, no kaba'lam.

84
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:40,380
Amin abanag, kaba'lan ti tao nga atdapamati na.

85
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:42,380
Kinunahan ni Jesus.

86
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:46,380
Atdapamati, ngam saan anan-anay?

87
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:48,380
Dagos nga inikis ti ama.

88
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:51,380
Unuam ti pagkurangan ti pamati.

89
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:56,380
Nadlaw ni Jesus nagi titatawo nga agdidinuron nga umasideg ken kuwana.

90
00:04:56,380 --> 00:04:59,380
Binilin na ti dakes nga espirito.

91
00:04:59,380 --> 00:05:02,380
Si kaatulan ken umal nga espirito.

92
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:05,380
Umanaw ka ito'y nga ubing.

93
00:05:05,380 --> 00:05:07,380
Ket di mo subsublyanan.

94
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:10,380
Nagikis ti dakes nga espirito.

95
00:05:10,380 --> 00:05:13,380
Pinagkisiw na ti ubing sa pimanaw.

96
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:16,380
Kaslabangkayan ti ubing ket adu tinagkuna.

97
00:05:16,380 --> 00:05:18,380
Natayon!

98
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:20,380
Ngim inigaman ni Jesus ti ima ti ubing.

99
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:22,380
Sana binangon.

100
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,380
Ti makder ti ubing.

101
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:27,380
Idinakastreken ni Jesus itibalay.

102
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:30,380
Sinalodsod as ilimed dagiti adalan na.

103
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:33,380
Apaya di minapaksyat ti espirito.

104
00:05:33,380 --> 00:05:38,380
Kararaglaang ti makapaksyat itiday taakita ti espirito.

105
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:41,380
Insumbat ni Jesus.

106
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:44,380
Ket awanin sa bali.

107
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:47,380
Timanaw da itiday taalugar.

108
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,380
Ket limasat da ije Galilya.

109
00:05:50,380 --> 00:05:54,380
Kaya't ni Jesus asaan amamuan dagiti tataw ti ayan na.

110
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:58,380
Agsipod ta isursuro na day to'y kadagiti adalan na.

111
00:05:58,380 --> 00:06:03,380
Mayawat to ti anak ti tao kadagiti mang papatay to kenkwana.

112
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:07,380
Ngim agungar to iti maikatlungal daw.

113
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:12,380
Ngim saan amawatan dagiti adalan na ti kaipapanan day to'y apanursuro na.

114
00:06:12,380 --> 00:06:15,380
Ket nagamakda nga agsalodsod kenkwana.

115
00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:18,380
Dimting da ije Kapernaum.

116
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:20,380
Ket idiadadan itibalay.

117
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:22,380
Sinalodsod ni Jesus kadakwada.

118
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:25,380
Anya ti nagsusupyatan nyo itidalan?

119
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:27,380
Ngim nagulimik da.

120
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:32,380
Ta itidalan nagsusupyatan da no si asino kadakwada ti kang runaan.

121
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:34,380
Nagtugaw ni Jesus.

122
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:40,380
Inayaban na dagiti sa nga pulo ket doang adalan sa nakinuna kadakwada.

123
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:43,380
Ti agtarigagay nga iso ti umuna.

124
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,380
Masapol nga agpaudi.

125
00:06:45,380 --> 00:06:47,380
Ket agsirbi iti amin.

126
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:50,380
Nangala itimaysa nga ubing.

127
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:52,380
Ket pinagtakdir na itisangwananda.

128
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:54,380
Kalpasan na.

129
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:56,380
Sinaklot na sa nakinuna.

130
00:06:56,380 --> 00:07:01,380
Ti umawat itimaysa kadagiti kakastoy nga ubing gapo kaniyak.

131
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:04,380
Siyak tiawaten na.

132
00:07:04,380 --> 00:07:06,380
Ket ti umawat kaniyak.

133
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:09,380
Saan laang asyak tiawaten na.

134
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:12,380
Nudibay ket tinangibaon kaniyak.

135
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:14,380
Maestro.

136
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:16,380
Tinunan ni Juan ken ni Jesus.

137
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:18,380
Nakita mi itimaysa ata.

138
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:20,380
Nangitin pa tayo,

139
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:23,380
amang pakpaksat kadagiti dimonyo.

140
00:07:23,380 --> 00:07:26,380
Babaan iti panangaramat na itinagan mo.

141
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:28,380
Pinaritan mi ka po ta ditay met kadawa.

142
00:07:28,380 --> 00:07:31,380
Imbaga ni Jesus kadakwada.

143
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:33,380
Diyo parparitan.

144
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:36,380
Taawan ti agaramid iti milagro.

145
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:39,380
Babaan iti panangaramat na itinagan ko.

146
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:41,380
Sa kalpasan na,

147
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:44,380
agsao kadagiti dakes abanag maipapankaniyak.

148
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:46,380
Takadua tayo ti siya sinuman a dibumusur kadatawag.

149
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:48,680
Tisya sinuman adibumusur kada tayo.

150
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:55,180
Laglagipan niyo, at tisya sinuman amang painom kada kayo itisang abaso adanom,

151
00:07:55,820 --> 00:08:01,200
gaputa taon na kayo ni Kristo, awaten ng tunga-awaten, tigong gunana.

152
00:08:01,980 --> 00:08:08,000
Tisya sinuman apakaigapwan tipanagbasol timaysa kada gitoy nga ubing amamati kaniyak.

153
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,640
Nasaysaya at kuma,

154
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:16,640
nung maigalot tidakkal agilingan abato ititanggad na sa maitapwak ititaaw.

155
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:18,740
Ngarod,

156
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:22,800
nuti imam tipakaigapwan tipanagbasol mo,

157
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,700
putdem,

158
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,360
nasaysaya at apukul ka asumrak itibiyag nga agnanayon,

159
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,640
ngumti adaan ka itidwanga ima,

160
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:37,040
kaya't mapan ka iji-infierno na ayan tiapoy adimaidep.

161
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:40,640
Nutisakam tipakaigapwan tipanagbasol,

162
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:42,640
putdem,

163
00:08:44,820 --> 00:08:49,300
nasaysaya at amay-may satisakam asumrak itibiyag nga agnanayon,

164
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:52,060
ngumti adaan ka itidwanga asaka,

165
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,640
kaya't maitapwak ka iji-infierno.

166
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:59,000
Nuti matam tipakaigapwan tipanagbasol mo,

167
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:00,820
swatem,

168
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:05,820
nasaysaya at abulding ka asumrak iji-pagaryan ti Diyos,

169
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,540
ngumti adaan ka itidwanga mata,

170
00:09:08,540 --> 00:09:10,540
kaya't maitapwak ka iji-infierno.

171
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,640
Sa djay,

172
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:16,640
saan amatay dagitiigas nga agkaan kadakwada,

173
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,640
kaya't tiapoy,

174
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,640
dimatmaidep,

175
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,640
tatitunggal maysa,

176
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,640
maguguranto itiapoy.

177
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,640
Nasaya at tiasin,

178
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:28,640
ngumnuawanin tiapgad na,

179
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:30,640
kasano tipanang paapgadyo manan?

180
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,640
Maadaan kayo kuma itiasin tipan nakigayyem,

181
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,640
kaya't maitapwak ka itiapgad na,

182
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,640
kasano tipanang paapgadyo manan?

183
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,640
Maadaan kayo kuma itiasin tipan nakigayyem,

184
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:39,860
kaya't maitapwak ka itiapgadyo manan.

185
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:39,880
Maadaan kayo kuma itiasin tipan nakigayyem,

186
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,880
kaya't magkakapya kayo.

